usage: aip <command> [args]

commands:
  validate
  schema
  runtime
  skill
  info
  run
  resume
  search
  list
  publish
  get
  pin
  retire
  config
  db
  server

`info` and `run` take a skill folder, or a published name when a server is configured (`aip config`, or AIP_SERVER).

